+// r35 S3 Rev 7 (Akiza review 537f3776, RULES-Q-15; Claude 28 Oct 2026). SELF-VERIFIED (builder = verifier), NOT independent.
+// Unit fixture (synthetic view, NOT a native duel) for the per-card responder guard on Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt (19304410):
+//  KT-2 core: with Kitt's effect on top of the chain, Ash Blossom, Infinite Impermanence and Effect Veiler are never chosen
+//   by the forced hand-trap rule and are blocked as activations (hand copies and a Set Imperm), even if offered.
